cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these evaluation artifacts, please cite the paper."
type: dataset
title: "Drift-Sense evaluation artifacts: manifests, per-pair predictions and report scripts"
abstract: "Evaluation artifacts released with the IRIS 27 paper 'Drift-Sense: Cross-Magnification Reference Localisation with Rejection in Repeating SEM Layouts'. Manifests and per-pair predictions for every reported method, plus the scripts that recompute the reported tables from the CSV files. No images and no model weights."
